    "Idle until sunset (%@) in %@ · %@ fade." : {
      "comment" : "Footer summary in iOS Settings > Circadian Mode when solar scheduling is enabled but currently inactive. The first %@ is today's sunset time, the second %@ is the selected region name, and the third %@ is the fade duration.",
      "localizations" : {
