    "Open Plozz on your Apple TV or another signed-in device and it’ll offer to add “%@” here automatically." : {
      "comment" : "Body text on the iOS Set Up This Device screen while waiting for another signed-in device to transfer one specific server. %@ is the server name this device asked to add.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "افتح Plozz على جهاز Apple TV أو جهاز آخر مسجل الدخول إليه، وستُعرض لك إمكانية إضافة «%@» هنا تلقائيًا."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
